[[File:Shrine of the Betrayer.png|thumb|300px|The Shrine of the Betrayer.]]
The '''Shrine of the Betrayer''' is a statue of [[Illidan Stormrage]] that is located east of the [[Shatter Scar Vale]] in [[Felwood]]. In recent times, [[Blood elf|blood elves]] of the [[Illidari]] have gathered here, led by the night elf demon hunter, [[Faladar Starsplinter]].

