[[Image:Silverwind Refuge.jpg|thumb|Silverwind Refuge]]
'''Silverwind Refuge'''{{co|50|66|Ashenvale}} is located in south-central [[Ashenvale]], just north of [[Mystral Lake]] and southwest of [[Greenpaw Village]]. It is a [[night elven]] settlement that contains [[quest giver]]s, [[vendor]]s, a [[hunter]] trainer, a [[pet trainer]], a [[skinning]] trainer, an [[herbalism trainer]], and an [[alchemy trainer]]. It is also a popular spot for fishing, since the Silverwind sentinels are ready at hand to aid should anything attack and the view on the lake which borders the Refuge is beautiful.

